  'Choose the account that matches your needs, review its terms, provide the required identification details, complete verification and confirm the channels available to you. Requirements may include BVN, NIN, accepted identity documents and proof of address depending on the account and current product rules.': 'Zaɓi asusun da ya dace da bukatunka, karanta sharuɗɗansa, bayar da bayanan tantancewa da ake buƙata, kammala tantancewa sannan ka tabbatar da hanyoyin da za ka iya amfani da su. Abubuwan da ake buƙata na iya haɗawa da BVN, NIN, takardun shaida da aka amince da su da shaidar adireshi, gwargwadon asusu da ƙa’idojin samfurin na yanzu.',
