  'What services are available in the app?': 'Waɗanne ayyuka ne ake da su a manhajar?',
  'Eligible customers may use the services that are enabled for their verified account, such as balance and transaction history, selected transfers, airtime purchases on supported networks and profile support. Features depend on account eligibility and current service availability.': 'Abokan cinikin da suka cancanta za su iya amfani da ayyukan da aka buɗe wa asusunsu da aka tantance, kamar duba ma’auni da tarihin mu’amaloli, wasu canja wurin kuɗi, sayen katin waya a hanyoyin sadarwa da ake tallafawa, da taimakon bayanan asusu. Ayyukan da ake samu sun danganta da cancantar asusu da samuwar sabis a yanzu.',
  'What should I do if a payment is pending?': 'Me zan yi idan biyan kuɗi yana jiran kammalawa?',
  'Check the transaction status in your account. If it remains pending or you notice an unfamiliar debit, contact Rima through a verified support channel and keep your transaction reference available. Never share your PIN, password or OTP with anyone.': 'Duba matsayin mu’amalar a asusunka. Idan har yanzu tana jiran kammalawa ko ka ga cire kuɗin da ba ka sani ba, tuntuɓi Rima ta hanyar taimako da aka tabbatar kuma ka tanadi lambar mu’amalarka. Kada ka taɓa ba kowa PIN, kalmar sirri ko OTP.',
  'What are my account limits?': 'Mene ne iyakokin asusuna?',
  'Limits depend on your verified account category, the service being used and current product rules. See the Fees & Limits page or contact Rima for the limits that apply to your account.': 'Iyakoki sun danganta da rukunin asusunka da aka tantance, sabis ɗin da kake amfani da shi da ƙa’idojin samfurin na yanzu. Duba shafin Kuɗaɗe da Iyakoki ko ka tuntuɓi Rima domin sanin iyakokin da suka shafi asusunka.',
  'I forgot my password or changed my phone. What next?': 'Na manta kalmar sirri ko na canza waya. Me zan yi?',
