  'Are loans or cards available through the app?': 'Ana iya samun rance ko kati ta manhajar?',
  'Digital loan applications are not part of the initial app release. Cards, POS terminals, USSD and other modules are only offered where the bank has formally approved and published them as available services.': 'Neman rancen dijital ba ya cikin sakin manhajar na farko. Ana bayar da kati, na’urorin POS, USSD da sauran sassa ne kawai idan bankin ya amince da su a hukumance kuma ya sanar da samuwarsu.',
  'How do I delete my app account or data?': 'Ta yaya zan share asusun manhaja ko bayanana?',
  'In the RIMA app, open Profile or Settings, select Delete Account, and follow the on-screen prompts to submit a deletion request. Selecting the option starts a request; it does not mean deletion is immediate or that your bank account is closed. Wait for confirmation, as the bank may need to verify the request and retain some records where required by law. Uninstalling the app does not delete your account.': 'A cikin manhajar Rima, buɗe Profile ko Settings, zaɓi Delete Account, sannan ka bi umarnin da ke allon domin aika buƙatar gogewa. Zaɓin yana fara buƙata ne; ba yana nufin za a goge bayanan nan take ko a rufe asusun bankinka ba. Jira tabbaci, domin banki na iya buƙatar tantance buƙatar da kuma riƙe wasu bayanai bisa doka. Cire manhajar daga waya ba ya goge asusunka.',
  'How do I make a complaint?': 'Ta yaya zan shigar da ƙorafi?',
  'Use the Complaints page or a verified Rima support channel. Keep your complaint reference, transaction details and any supporting screenshots or receipts. If the matter remains unresolved, you may follow the escalation steps published by the bank and relevant regulator.': 'Yi amfani da shafin Korafe-korafe ko hanyar taimakon Rima da aka tabbatar. Riƙe lambar ƙorafinka, bayanan mu’amala da hotunan allo ko rasit masu goyon baya. Idan ba a warware matsalar ba, za ka iya bin matakan ɗaukaka ƙorafin da banki da hukumar kula da harkokin suka wallafa.',
  'How can I protect my account?': 'Ta yaya zan kare asusuna?',
  'Keep your login credentials private, use official contact channels and app links, secure your phone with a screen lock, and never share your PIN, password or OTP. Verify payment details before sending money and report suspected fraud through a verified channel immediately.': 'Ka ɓoye bayanan shiga asusunka, yi amfani da hanyoyin tuntuɓa da manhajojin hukuma, kulle wayarka, kuma kada ka ba kowa PIN, kalmar sirri ko OTP. Tabbatar da bayanan biyan kuɗi kafin aikawa, kuma ka gaggauta kai rahoton zargin zamba ta hanyar da aka tabbatar.',

