  'Read professional profiles of Rima directors.': 'Karanta bayanan ƙwararrun daraktocin Rima.',
  'Find Rima management team profiles.': 'Nemo bayanan ƙungiyar gudanarwar Rima.',
  'Learn about Rima’s roots, mission, vision and values.': 'Ƙara sani game da tushen Rima, manufa, hangen nesa da ƙimominta.',
  'Review the Fees & Limits page or contact Rima for the limits that apply to your account.': 'Duba shafin Kuɗaɗe da Iyakoki ko ka tuntuɓi Rima domin sanin iyakokin da suka shafi asusunka.',
  'Click or press Enter to search': 'Danna ko latsa Enter domin bincika',
  'OUR STORY / THE RIMA NAME': 'TARIHINMU / SUNAN RIMA',
  'Our name.': 'Sunanmu.',
  'Our roots.': 'Tushenmu.',
  'Our purpose.': 'Manufarmu.',
  'Inspired by the Rima River. Committed to the people it sustains.': 'Kogin Rima ne ya zaburar da mu. Mun himmatu ga mutanen da yake tallafawa.',
  'In northern Nigeria, water carries a significance that reaches beyond its banks. It nourishes the land, sustains livelihoods and shapes the possibilities of entire communities. The Rima River embodies that significance — a familiar presence in the landscape of the North-West and a powerful expression of the relationship between natural resources, enterprise and everyday life.': 'A arewacin Najeriya, ruwa yana da muhimmanci fiye da iyakokin koginsa. Yana ba ƙasa ruwa, tallafa wa rayuwar mutane kuma ya tsara damar al’ummomi gaba ɗaya. Kogin Rima yana nuna wannan muhimmanci — sanannen ɓangare na yanayin Arewa maso Yamma kuma alamar dangantakar albarkatun ƙasa, sana’a da rayuwar yau da kullum.',
  'Rima Microfinance Bank takes its name from this river. In that name, we recognise a heritage of sustenance, connection and opportunity: the same qualities we aspire to bring to the communities we serve.': 'Rima Microfinance Bank ta samo sunanta daga wannan kogi. A cikin wannan suna, muna gane gadon tallafi, haɗin kai da dama: waɗannan su ne halayen da muke fatan kawowa al’ummomin da muke yi wa hidima.',
  'A RIVER WOVEN INTO THE LIFE OF THE NORTH': 'KOGI DA YA ZAMA ƁANGAREN RAYUWAR AREWA',
  'The Rima is more than water. It is a': 'Rima ya wuce ruwa kawai. Shi ne',
  'mainstay.': 'ginshiƙi.',
  'The Rima forms part of the wider Sokoto–Rima river system, connected to the Niger through the Sokoto River. Its upper reaches follow the rhythm of the seasons, drawing strength from rainfall and the streams that feed them. Across the wider system, river channels, floodplains, pools and reservoirs create environments that support fishing and agricultural livelihoods.': 'Kogin Rima ɓangare ne na babban tsarin kogunan Sokoto–Rima, wanda ya haɗu da Kogin Niger ta Kogin Sokoto. Sassan samansa suna bin sauyin yanayi, suna samun ruwa daga ruwan sama da rafukan da ke ciyar da su. A duk faɗin wannan tsarin, koguna, filayen ambaliya, tafkuna da madatsun ruwa suna samar da muhallin da ke tallafa wa kamun kifi da noma.',
  'In a region marked by distinct wet and dry seasons, access to water is a foundation of economic activity. The Goronyo reservoir on the Rima River and the Middle Rima Valley irrigation infrastructure demonstrate how this resource can support cultivation and food production beyond dependence on rainfall alone.': 'A yankin da damina da rani suka bambanta, samun ruwa shi ne ginshiƙin ayyukan tattalin arziki. Madatsar ruwan Goronyo a Kogin Rima da tsarin ban-ruwa na Middle Rima Valley suna nuna yadda wannan albarkatu ke tallafa wa noma da samar da abinci ba tare da dogaro da ruwan sama kaɗai ba.',
  'Livelihoods': 'Hanyoyin samun abin rayuwa',
  'The river’s importance is reflected in the farmer preparing a field, the fishing household earning its livelihood and the businesses that grow around agricultural production.': 'Muhimmancin kogin yana bayyana ga manomin da ke shirya gona, iyalin masunta da ke samun abin rayuwa da kasuwancin da ke bunƙasa kusa da noman.',
  'Enterprise': 'Sana’a',
  'Research on the Middle Rima Valley identifies rice production and processing as an important local value chain — linking cultivation to enterprise and income.': 'Bincike a Middle Rima Valley ya nuna noman shinkafa da sarrafa ta a matsayin muhimmiyar hanyar darajar tattalin arziki ta yankin — tana haɗa noma da sana’a da kuɗin shiga.',
  'Opportunity': 'Dama',
  'Resources create greater value when they reach productive hands. That is the lesson we carry into responsible financial services.': 'Albarkatu suna samar da ƙima mafi girma idan sun isa hannun masu amfani da su wajen samarwa. Wannan darasi muke amfani da shi a ayyukan kuɗi masu alhaki.',
  'FROM COMMUNITY ROOTS TO A DIGITAL FUTURE': 'DAGA TUSHEN AL’UMMA ZUWA MAKOMAR DIJITAL',
  'Technology gives us new ways to serve. Our roots remind us': 'Fasaha tana ba mu sabbin hanyoyin hidima. Tushenmu yana tuna mana',
  'whom we serve.': 'waɗanda muke yi wa hidima.',
  'We want banking to be understandable to the trader, useful to the small business, accessible to the household and responsive to the customer whose livelihood depends on careful management of money.': 'Muna son banki ya kasance mai sauƙin fahimta ga ɗan kasuwa, mai amfani ga ƙaramin kamfani, mai sauƙin samu ga iyali kuma mai amsa wa abokin cinikin da rayuwarsa ta dogara da sarrafa kuɗi da kyau.',
  'We carry the river’s name with pride — and with the responsibility to make that name meaningful in our customers’ lives.': 'Muna ɗauke da sunan kogin cikin alfahari — tare da alhakin sa wannan suna ya zama mai ma’ana a rayuwar abokan cinikinmu.',
  'Rima Microfinance Bank. Rooted in our heritage. Growing with our communities.': 'Rima Microfinance Bank. Mun samo asali daga gadonmu. Muna bunƙasa tare da al’ummominmu.',
  'Explore your options': 'Duba zaɓuɓɓukanka',
  'A CLEARER WAY FORWARD': 'HANYA BAYYANANNIYA TA GABA',
  'Clear information before you commit.': 'Bayani bayyananne kafin ka amince.',
  'Confirm eligibility, opening requirements, minimum balance, withdrawal conditions, applicable charges and account limits.': 'Tabbatar da cancanta, buƙatun buɗewa, mafi ƙarancin ma’auni, sharuɗɗan cire kuɗi, kuɗaɗen da suka dace da iyakokin asusu.',
  'Provide the required personal details and identification, complete verification, and confirm the channels available for your account.': 'Bayar da bayanan mutum da takardun shaida da ake buƙata, kammala tantancewa, sannan tabbatar da hanyoyin da ake da su ga asusunka.',
  'Tell us about your work': 'Faɗa mana game da sana’arka',
  'Ask about accounts suitable for your trading, service business, registered company, cooperative or group.': 'Tambayi game da asusun da ya dace da kasuwancinka, sana’ar sabis, kamfani mai rajista, ƙungiyar haɗin gwiwa ko rukuni.',
  'Confirm the documents': 'Tabbatar da takardu',
  'Requirements depend on legal structure and may include registration, ownership, signatory identification, tax details and an operating resolution.': 'Buƙatu sun danganta da tsarin doka kuma na iya haɗawa da rajista, mallaka, shaidar masu sa hannu, bayanan haraji da ƙudurin gudanarwa.',
  'Agree how it operates': 'Yarda da yadda yake aiki',
  'Review the operating mandate, authorised access, transaction limits, applicable charges and current product terms before proceeding.': 'Duba umarnin gudanarwa, damar shiga da aka ba da izini, iyakokin mu’amala, kuɗaɗen da suka dace da sharuɗɗan samfur na yanzu kafin ci gaba.',
  'Account opening': 'Buɗe asusu',
  'Account maintenance': 'Kula da asusu',
  'Transfer within Rima': 'Canja kuɗi tsakanin asusun Rima',
  'Transfer to another bank': 'Canja kuɗi zuwa wani banki',
  'Airtime, data and bill payments': 'Katin waya, data da biyan kuɗaɗen hidima',
  'Statements': 'Bayanan asusu',
  'Approved product terms apply': 'Sharuɗɗan samfur da aka amince da su ne ke aiki',
  'Published at transaction confirmation': 'Ana nuna su lokacin tabbatar da mu’amala',
  'Ask the bank about the applicable terms': 'Tambayi banki game da sharuɗɗan da suka dace',
