  'Spot the warning signs.': 'Gane alamun gargaɗi.',
  'Keep credentials private': 'Ka ɓoye bayanan shiga',
  'Never share your PIN, password or one-time passcode with anyone, including someone claiming to work for Rima.': 'Kada ka taɓa ba kowa PIN, kalmar sirri ko lambar sirri ta amfani sau ɗaya, har da wanda ya ce yana aiki da Rima.',
  'Know who you are sending to.': 'San wanda kake aika wa.',
  'Review details before confirming a transfer.': 'Duba bayanai kafin tabbatar da canja kuɗi.',
