  'Community, in': 'Al’umma, cikin',
  'focus.': 'haske.',
  'A curated collection of Rima-branded imagery centred on community, local enterprise and modern banking.': 'Tarin hotunan Rima da aka zaɓa, waɗanda suka mayar da hankali kan al’umma, sana’o’in yankin da banki na zamani.',
