  'RIMA / SERVICE INFORMATION': 'RIMA / BAYANAN SABIS',
  'Service status,': 'Matsayin sabis,',
  'clearly reported.': 'a bayyane.',
  'When Rima confirms maintenance or a service disruption, this page should explain what is affected, what customers may notice and when to expect another update. A live status feed is not connected yet, so current availability cannot be confirmed here.': 'Idan Rima ta tabbatar da gyara ko katsewar sabis, wannan shafi zai bayyana abin da abin ya shafa, abin da abokan ciniki za su iya lura da shi da lokacin da za a sake sabuntawa. Ba a haɗa bayanan matsayin sabis kai tsaye ba tukuna, saboda haka ba za a iya tabbatar da samuwarsa a nan ba.',
  'Service status feed': 'Bayanan matsayin sabis',
  'PUBLIC STATUS FEED': 'BAYANAN MATSAYI NA JAMA’A',
  'Live updates are not connected': 'Ba a haɗa sabuntawa kai tsaye ba',
  'This page does not currently receive verified service data. No outage or all-clear is being reported.': 'A halin yanzu wannan shafi ba ya karɓar bayanan sabis da aka tabbatar. Ba a bayar da rahoton katsewa ko cewa komai yana aiki ba.',
  '01 / WHAT TO EXPECT': '01 / ABIN DA ZA A GANI',
  'Useful details,': 'Muhimman bayanai,',
  'not vague alerts.': 'ba sanarwa marar bayani ba.',
  'Each notice should identify the affected service and the customer impact, then be updated as the situation changes.': 'Kowace sanarwa za ta bayyana sabis ɗin da abin ya shafa da tasirinsa ga abokan ciniki, sannan a sabunta ta yayin da yanayin ke canzawa.',
  'Affected service': 'Sabis ɗin da abin ya shafa',
  'Which service is affected, the kind of issue, and what customers may be unable to do.': 'Sabis ɗin da abin ya shafa, irin matsalar, da abin da abokan ciniki ba za su iya yi ba.',
  'Timing and progress': 'Lokaci da ci gaba',
  'When the issue began or maintenance is planned, the latest confirmed progress, and when another update is due.': 'Lokacin da matsalar ta fara ko aka tsara gyara, sabon ci gaban da aka tabbatar, da lokacin sabuntawa na gaba.',
  'Resolution and next steps': 'Warwarewa da matakai na gaba',
  'When service is confirmed restored and any action customers should take afterwards.': 'Lokacin da aka tabbatar an dawo da sabis da duk wani mataki da abokan ciniki ya kamata su ɗauka.',
  '02 / WHERE UPDATES COME FROM': '02 / INA AKE SAMUN SABUNTAWA',
  'Verified by the people': 'Mutanen da ke da alhakin sabis ne',
  'responsible for service.': 'ke tabbatar da bayanan.',
  '“Live” means notices are published as an event is confirmed and its status changes. It does not mean this website can see a customer’s account or transactions.': '“Kai tsaye” na nufin ana wallafa sanarwa da zarar an tabbatar da wani lamari ko matsayinsa ya canza. Ba yana nufin wannan shafi na iya ganin asusun ko mu’amalolin abokin ciniki ba.',
  'Bank operations and technology teams': 'Ƙungiyoyin ayyuka da fasaha na banki',
  'Authorized staff confirm incidents, customer impact, planned maintenance and restoration before a notice is published.': 'Ma’aikatan da aka ba izini suna tabbatar da matsala, tasirinta ga abokan ciniki, gyaran da aka tsara da dawo da sabis kafin wallafa sanarwa.',
  'Service monitoring, when connected': 'Sa ido kan sabis, idan an haɗa shi',
  'Production health checks can flag issues with bank-operated website, app or API services. A monitor can raise an alert, but the bank must confirm its customer impact.': 'Gwajin lafiyar tsarin aiki na iya gano matsaloli a shafin yanar gizo, manhaja ko API da banki ke sarrafawa. Na’urar sa ido na iya aika gargaɗi, amma dole ne banki ya tabbatar da tasirinsa ga abokan ciniki.',
  'Payment partners, when verified': 'Abokan hulɗar biyan kuɗi, idan an tabbatar',
  'Third-party service notices should only be included when a provider reports an issue or Rima confirms that it affects a customer service.': 'A saka sanarwar sabis na wani kamfani ne kawai idan mai samar da sabis ya bayar da rahoton matsala ko Rima ta tabbatar tana shafar sabis ga abokan ciniki.',
  'No monitoring integration or authorized publishing feed is connected to this page at present.': 'A halin yanzu ba a haɗa tsarin sa ido ko hanyar wallafa bayanai mai izini da wannan shafi ba.',
  'NEED TO CHECK A SERVICE?': 'KANA SON TANTANCE SABIS?',
  'If you are having trouble with a transaction or account, use a bank contact channel you have independently verified from official bank documents. Do not share your PIN, password or one-time passcode.': 'Idan kana fuskantar matsala da mu’amala ko asusu, yi amfani da hanyar tuntuɓar banki da ka tabbatar da kanka daga takardun banki na hukuma. Kada ka bayyana PIN, kalmar sirri ko lambar sirri ta amfani sau ɗaya.',
  'Support guidance': 'Jagorar taimako',
