  'Directors.': 'Daraktoci.',
  'The Board brings together accomplished professionals whose experience, judgement and commitment to responsible governance help guide Rima’s growth and strengthen the communities we serve. Explore each profile to learn more about their leadership and areas of expertise.': 'Kwamitin ya haɗa ƙwararrun mutane masu gogewa, hangen nesa da himma ga shugabanci nagari, waɗanda ke taimaka wa bunƙasar Rima da ƙarfafa al’ummomin da muke yi wa hidima. Duba bayanan kowane mutum domin ƙarin sani game da jagorancinsa da ƙwarewarsa.',
