  'This nomination as a non-executive director remains subject to clearance.': 'Wannan naɗi a matsayin darakta mara zartarwa yana jiran izini.',
  'Meet the people whose professional experience and service help shape Rima Microfinance Bank.': 'Haɗu da mutanen da ƙwarewarsu da hidimarsu ke taimakawa wajen tsara Rima Microfinance Bank.',
  'Professional Profile': 'Bayanan Ƙwarewa',
