  'forward view.': 'hangen gaba.',
  'Rima Microfinance Bank is a Nigerian microfinance bank with roots in Sokoto State. Established in 1993, we serve customers whose ambitions begin with everyday needs: saving for a family goal, managing business income and building a more stable livelihood.': 'Rima Microfinance Bank bankin kuɗi ƙarami ne na Najeriya mai tushe a Jihar Sokoto. An kafa shi a 1993; muna yi wa abokan cinikin da burinsu ya fara da bukatun yau da kullum hidima: yin ajiyar burin iyali, sarrafa kuɗin shiga na sana’a da gina ingantacciyar rayuwa.',
  'MADE BY US FOR US': 'MU AKA YI DOMINMU',
  'A name with a community at its heart.': 'Suna mai ɗauke da al’umma a zuciyarsa.',
  'The Rima identity reflects a belief in practical, community-rooted financial services.': 'Alamar Rima tana nuna imani da ayyukan kuɗi masu amfani da suka samo tushe a cikin al’umma.',
  'Our mission': 'Manufarmu',
  'To make practical financial services more accessible to individuals and small businesses through responsible banking, clear communication and useful technology.': 'Samar da ayyukan kuɗi masu amfani ga mutane da ƙananan ’yan kasuwa ta hanyar banki mai alhaki, sadarwa bayyananniya da fasaha mai amfani.',
  'Our vision': 'Hangen nesanmu',
  'To be a trusted microfinance bank that connects community banking with the convenience of digital financial services.': 'Zama bankin kuɗi ƙarami amintacce wanda ke haɗa bankin al’umma da sauƙin ayyukan kuɗi na dijital.',
  'Who we serve': 'Waɗanda muke yi wa hidima',
  'Individuals and households, traders and microenterprises, eligible salary earners, and properly documented businesses, cooperatives and groups, subject to approved products and account-opening requirements.': 'Mutane da iyalai, ’yan kasuwa da ƙananan sana’o’i, masu albashi da suka cancanta, da kamfanoni, ƙungiyoyin haɗin gwiwa da rukuni masu takardu masu kyau, bisa kayayyakin da aka amince da su da buƙatun buɗe asusu.',
  'WHAT GUIDES US': 'ABIN DA KE JAGORANTARMU',
  'Trust': 'Amincewa',
  'We explain our services clearly and handle customer concerns responsibly.': 'Muna bayyana ayyukanmu a sarari kuma muna kula da damuwar abokan ciniki cikin alhaki.',
  'Inclusion': 'Haɗa kowa',
  'We help customers understand their options and the requirements for using them.': 'Muna taimaka wa abokan ciniki su fahimci zaɓuɓɓukansu da buƙatun amfani da su.',
  'Responsibility': 'Alhaki',
  'We apply identity verification, risk controls and applicable regulatory requirements.': 'Muna aiwatar da tantance shaida, matakan kula da haɗari da ƙa’idojin hukumomi da suka dace.',
  'Service': 'Hidima',
  'We focus on useful products and accessible support.': 'Muna mai da hankali kan kayayyaki masu amfani da taimako mai sauƙin samu.',
  'LEGAL & REGULATORY': 'DOKA DA HUKUMOMI',
  'The exact legal entity name, registered address, current licence category and branch address must be verified against the bank’s official records before any public launch claim is made. Public information must match approved documentation and be kept current.': 'Dole ne a tabbatar da cikakken sunan ƙungiyar doka, adireshin rajista, rukunin lasisi na yanzu da adireshin reshe daga bayanan hukuma na banki kafin yin wani ikirarin ƙaddamarwa ga jama’a. Dole bayanan jama’a su dace da takardun da aka amince da su kuma a sabunta su.',
  'Rima Microfinance Bank is expected to be subject to CBN regulation and NDIC membership where applicable, but the final wording and proof should be confirmed by the bank’s legal and compliance team before publication.': 'Ana sa ran Rima Microfinance Bank za ta kasance ƙarƙashin dokokin CBN da zama mamba a NDIC inda ya dace, amma dole ƙungiyar shari’a da bin ƙa’idoji ta banki ta tabbatar da rubutun ƙarshe da hujja kafin wallafawa.',
  'Rima Microfinance Bank. Rooted in community. Building with confidence.': 'Rima Microfinance Bank. Tushenta a cikin al’umma. Tana gina makoma cikin amincewa.',
  'Explore our services': 'Duba ayyukanmu',
  'OUR ROOTS / OUR PEOPLE': 'TUSHENMU / MUTANENMU',
  'A familiar place to start.': 'Wuri sananne na fara aiki.',
  'Good banking begins with listening. We aim to make every conversation clear, welcoming and grounded in the needs of the people we serve.': 'Banki mai kyau yana farawa da sauraro. Muna son kowace tattaunawa ta kasance bayyananniya, mai maraba kuma bisa bukatun mutanen da muke yi wa hidima.',
  'Discover our story': 'Gano tarihinmu',
  'SERVICE THAT STARTS WITH PEOPLE': 'HIDIMA DA KE FARAWA DA MUTANE',
  'Community is more than a place.': 'Al’umma ta fi zama wuri kawai.',
  'It is the trust built in everyday conversations, the support behind a small business and the care that helps families plan what comes next.': 'Ita ce amincewar da ake ginawa a tattaunawar yau da kullum, tallafin da ke bayan ƙaramin kasuwanci da kulawar da ke taimaka wa iyalai tsara mataki na gaba.',
  'PERSONAL BANKING / HERE TO HELP': 'BANKIN MUTANE / A NAN DOMIN TAIMAKO',
  'Make a plan that feels like yours.': 'Yi shirin da ya dace da kai.',
  'Whether you are saving for a household goal or managing everyday money, our team can help explain the options and terms available.': 'Ko kana yin ajiya domin burin iyali ko sarrafa kuɗin yau da kullum, ma’aikatanmu za su iya bayyana zaɓuɓɓuka da sharuɗɗan da ake da su.',
