  'From a local shop to a growing enterprise, speak with Rima about organising business funds and the account requirements that apply.': 'Daga shagon yankin zuwa kasuwancin da ke bunƙasa, yi magana da Rima game da tsara kuɗin kasuwanci da buƙatun asusu da suka dace.',
