  'Store badges are preview artwork only. The app is not yet available to download; official links will be added after release is confirmed.': 'Alamomin shagunan manhaja hotunan samfuri ne kawai. Ba a buɗe manhajar don saukewa ba tukuna; za a ƙara hanyoyin sauke ta na hukuma bayan tabbatar da sakin ta.',
  'ABOUT RIMA MFB · GAME DA MU': 'GAME DA RIMA MFB · GAME DA MU',
  '30+ years of community banking': 'Fiye da shekaru 30 na bankin al’umma',
  'in the North.': 'a Arewa.',
  'Rima Microfinance Bank’s published story begins in 1992 in Gwaranyo LGA, Sokoto State. Over more than three decades, its focus has been the financial lives of traders, farmers, civil servants and households across Northern Nigeria.': 'Tarihin da Rima Microfinance Bank ta wallafa ya fara ne a 1992 a Gwaranyo LGA, Jihar Sokoto. Fiye da shekaru talatin, ta mayar da hankali kan rayuwar kuɗi ta ’yan kasuwa, manoma, ma’aikatan gwamnati da iyalai a Arewacin Najeriya.',
  'Today, Rima is shaping its next chapter around community-rooted service and a digital transformation intended to broaden access. “Made For Us, By Us” is a commitment to build with the people and communities the bank serves.': 'A yau, Rima tana tsara sabon babi ta hanyar hidimar da ta samo tushe daga al’umma da sauyin dijital da aka yi niyyar faɗaɗa dama. “Made For Us, By Us” alƙawari ne na gina tare da mutane da al’ummomin da bankin ke yi wa hidima.',
