  'Show metric group': 'Nuna rukunin ma’auni',
  'Year Founded': 'Shekarar kafawa',
  'Current Customers': 'Abokan ciniki na yanzu',
  'Year 1 Target': 'Burin shekara ta 1',
  'POS Terminals': 'Na’urorin POS',
  'Years of Service': 'Shekarun hidima',
  'Revenue Streams': 'Hanyoyin samun kuɗi',
  'ROOTED IN THE NORTH-WEST': 'TUSHENMU A AREWA MASO YAMMA',
  'GROWING WITH OUR COMMUNITIES': 'MUNA BUNKASA TARE DA AL’UMMOMINMU',
  'A NAME WITH A SOURCE': 'SUNA MAI TUSHE',
  '01 / HERITAGE': '01 / GADO',
  'A river can sustain more than': 'Kogi na iya tallafa wa fiye da',
  'the land.': 'ƙasa.',
  'In northern Nigeria, water carries a significance that reaches beyond its banks. It nourishes the land, sustains livelihoods and shapes the possibilities of entire communities. The Rima River is a familiar presence in the North-West landscape and a reminder of how closely natural resources, enterprise and everyday life are connected.': 'A arewacin Najeriya, ruwa yana da muhimmanci fiye da iyakokin koginsa. Yana ciyar da ƙasa, tallafa wa rayuwar mutane kuma ya tsara damar al’ummomi gaba ɗaya. Kogin Rima sanannen ɓangare ne na yanayin Arewa maso Yamma kuma yana tunatar da mu yadda albarkatun ƙasa, sana’a da rayuwar yau da kullum ke da alaƙa.',
  'Rima Microfinance Bank takes its name from this river. In that name, we recognise a heritage of sustenance, connection and opportunity — qualities we aspire to bring to the communities we serve.': 'Rima Microfinance Bank ta samo sunanta daga wannan kogi. A cikin wannan suna, muna gane gadon tallafi, haɗin kai da dama — halayen da muke fatan kawowa al’ummomin da muke yi wa hidima.',
  'Rima’s people and community': 'Mutanen Rima da al’umma',
  'Customers speaking with the Rima team in a welcoming branch': 'Abokan ciniki suna magana da ma’aikatan Rima a reshe mai maraba',
  'A CONNECTION TO PLACE.': 'HAƊIN KAI DA YANKI.',
  'A COMMITMENT TO PEOPLE.': 'HIMMA GA MUTANE.',
  'COMMUNITY FIRST': 'AL’UMMA FARKO',
  'The Rima forms part of the wider Sokoto–Rima river system, connected to the Niger through the Sokoto River. Across this system, river channels, floodplains, pools and reservoirs support fishing and agricultural livelihoods.': 'Kogin Rima ɓangare ne na babban tsarin kogunan Sokoto–Rima, wanda ya haɗu da Niger ta Kogin Sokoto. A duk faɗin wannan tsari, koguna, filayen ambaliya, tafkuna da madatsun ruwa suna tallafa wa kamun kifi da hanyoyin samun abin rayuwa na noma.',
  'In a region marked by distinct wet and dry seasons, access to water is a foundation of economic activity. The Goronyo reservoir and Middle Rima Valley irrigation infrastructure show how this resource can support cultivation and food production beyond dependence on rainfall alone.': 'A yankin da damina da rani suka bambanta, samun ruwa shi ne ginshiƙin ayyukan tattalin arziki. Madatsar ruwan Goronyo da tsarin ban-ruwa na Middle Rima Valley suna nuna yadda wannan albarkatu ke tallafa wa noma da samar da abinci ba tare da dogaro da ruwan sama kaɗai ba.',
  'WHAT THE RIVER REPRESENTS': 'ABIN DA KOGIN KE NUNI DA SHI',
